<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinals in the Australian Men's Hardcourt Championships on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) 6-7 (6-8) 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-1 3-6 6-2.</p>
</text>
